            "notes_base": "Pick up rental car at Lijiang Sanyi Airport after landing (~20:30). Recommended: SUV such as Toyota RAV4 or Jeep Compass for Yunnan mountain roads. Rental companies at LJG airport: Shenzhou Zuchē (神州租车), Yīhǎi Zuchē (一嗨租车), Wúkōng Zuchē (悟空租车). Estimated 7-day SUV rental cost: CNY 400-600/day = CNY 2,800-4,200 total (split between 2 people). Drive airport to Old Town: ~30km, ~53 minutes. Note: some Old Town inner streets are pedestrian-only — park at designated lots near the gate and walk in. Having a rental car enables flexible self-drive for: Day 3 (Jade Dragon Snow Mountain), Day 5 (Lijiang → Dali drive), Day 6 (Erhai Lake circuit), Day 8 (Xizhou), Day 9 (Dali Airport drop-off). Book rental in advance at app or airport counter.",
            "notes_local": "落地约20:30后在丽江三义机场取车。推荐SUV车型（如丰田RAV4或Jeep指南者），适合云南山区路况。机场租车公司：神州租车、一嗨租车、悟空租车。7天SUV租车估价：400-600元/天，合计约2800-4200元（两人共摊）。机场到古城约30公里，约53分钟。注意：丽江古城部分内街不允许机动车通行，需停在古城门口停车场步行进入。有了租车可灵活安排：第3天（玉龙雪山）、第5天（丽江→大理自驾）、第6天（环洱海）、第8天（喜洲）、第9天（还车大理凤仪机场）。建议提前在APP或机场柜台预订。",
